        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of progressive lower limb spasticity with autosomal dominant family history and confirmed pathogenic mutation in KIAA0196 gene",
    "notes": "Genetic testing is essential to confirm diagnosis and exclude other forms of hereditary spastic paraplegia."
